# Round 18, C2-9 (follows). L §5.14.3: flows with a move m "is the sum of that move's movements in the span, over its
# instances at the stated keys ..., plus the settlements of those instances' adjustments dated in the span". The model
# of L5_14_3_settle_adjusts_ends: pay[] (2026-01-05) is booked at A0 = 0 and its adjustment is settled by arr on
# 2026-02-10, +100.00 PLN. flows(pay, 2026-01) holds the instance and no settlement: 0.00 PLN; flows(pay, 2026-02)
# holds the settlement, dated in it, though not the instance: 100.00 PLN; flows(arr, 2026-02), arr's own movement:
# 100.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place zus: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input ok: bool
input d1: date
input d2: date
move pay: pays
  on d1
  when ok
  leg cash from zus to konto amount amt
move arr[a in adjustments on d2 where a.adjusts in pays]: pays
  on d2
  at a.day
  leg cash from a.adjusts.cash.from to a.adjusts.cash.to amount max(a.change, 0)
  fulfils a
source s "x"
version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100
  ok = false
  d1 = 2026-01-05
  d2 = 2026-02-10
  opening[konto] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start
version v2
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-02-10
  replace ok = true
ask q: flows(pay, 2026-01), flows(pay, 2026-02), flows(arr, 2026-02) law cut
=== expect
q: (0.00 PLN, 100.00 PLN, 100.00 PLN)
  law date 2026-02-10, cut 2026-02-10
